WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.453
Positively curved Einstein four manifolds.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.841
A volume argument balances the two halves of the Weyl curvature exactly.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.506
A polynomial inequality forces one half to vanish, leaving the symmetric models.

4
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.528
Claimed: round sphere, projective space, or Fubini Study.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.047
Lean checks part.
